flowchart LR
    MCP[MCP client]
    A2A[Standalone A2A client]
    R[POST /mcp]
    X[no A2A endpoint, cannot connect]
    MW[authGuard middleware PR 2]
    TR[StreamableHTTP transport]
    REG[server.registerTool]
    T1[Existing MCP tools]
    T2[NEW a2a.* tools]
    AUTH[AuthAdapter]
    SVC[services layer]

    MCP --> R
    A2A -.->|fails| X
    R --> MW
    MW --> TR
    TR --> REG
    REG --> T1
    REG --> T2
    MW -.-> AUTH
    T1 --> SVC
    T2 --> SVC
